  "comment": "Channels 13 to 16 are stereo and take two jacks each, printed L and R; that is why there are twenty audio inputs for sixteen channels. The panel prints INSERT 1 - 12 but the module sets eight channels on the insert output, so only the first eight channels are actually sent; the insert output's own line says so. The aux send knobs share their places with the pan CV attenuators, and the aux 2 send knobs with the track routing buttons, the display button choosing which set is shown; both are given lines. Parameters 149 to 152 are named Group 1 to Group 4 by the maker but the code passes them to a group solo check."
